## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design an edge-friendly, few-shot adaptable vision system with robust localization under real-time constraints and production-domain data shifts.

## Key Concepts

- Edge-efficient architectures, few-shot adapters
- Synthetic+real data for defect distribution
- Temporal consistency and localization losses

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: forward pass outline
function forward(frame, adapter) {
  const feat = backbone(frame);
  const heatmap = detectorHead(feat);
  const adapted = adapter(feat);
  const localized = fuse(heatmap, adapted);
  return localized;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate real-time performance on hardware with varying thermal conditions?
- What failure modes require monitoring in production and how would you mitigate them?

